# Guard film (docs/BUGS.md 176, the step 5 code review 2026-11-07): a Matabele major carrying a hurt minor (two legs
# gone) in its jaws, head first down a dead mound's chimney: a hump of stone 4 high with a shaft one block wide through
# it, its near wall glass so the camera sees in. The carried ant must hang under the carrier's head on the wall as on
# the floor, never inside the shaft's walls (it was placed by the carrier's facing only, as if on flat ground).
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
cmd fill -4 -60 -2 2 -57 2 stone
cmd fill 0 -60 0 0 -57 0 air
cmd fill 0 -60 -2 0 -57 -1 glass
lens 30
walker matabele_major -2.5 -56 0.5 -90 BodyLength:15f
cmd summon antcolonies:matabele_minor -1.5 -56 0.5
step 10
log carry_down
cmd antcolonies carryhurt
step 10
cmd tick freeze
fov 14
follow 0 1.0 -3.5 0 15
go 0 -60 0 1.0
burst carry_down 140 1
log off
follow off
quit
